    "title": "Road reopened following multi-vehicle crash on MLK Parkway - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Hannah Hall ,\n8 hours ago\nNEW HANOVER COUNTY, N.C. (WECT) - Roadways are reopened following a multi-vehicle crash in New Hanover County Thursday afternoon. According to DriveNC, the crash happened on MLK Parkway near N. Kerr Avenue. A spokesperson with the Wilmington Police Department (WPD) said the crash involved three vehicles, including an 18-wheeler. DriveNC...\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources\n1",
